{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>人民幣債券以美元計價的回報，今年來跑贏不少貨幣債券。外匯及商品分析師盧楚仁解釋，在內地減息寬鬆環境下，人民幣債券收益率一向低企，但債價相對上升，加上人民幣升值，令總回報跑贏。他預計，離岸人民幣或升至6.6、6.5水平，並利好人民幣債券回報表現。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:39:20.623288+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T05:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T06:38:06.916388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:37:41.742818+00:00","content_hash":"c6c62f048ae71badf08bf345d9dc2a3b1cc4499b79ef845aa4431029ea86bf66","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}